# Operator goals

A handful of lines describing what you (the operator) are actually trying to achieve right now, so agents
can prioritize "moves the needle" over "noise". This file is surfaced to each agent on the first message
of a fresh session (bounded, within the shared memory-preamble budget) and can be linked from a kanban
card's `project` field.

Keep it SHORT — a few bullets. Replace the examples below with your own; delete this preamble.

- Ship the current migration without breaking production.
- The owner's calendar and health commitments never slip.
- Keep monthly infra spend under the agreed cap.
